@startuml CPN-19-holdout-sequence
title CPN-19 — Séquence hash -> bucket et cohérence affichage/checkout

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Affichage /kit\n(Server Component)" as Display
participant "order-repo\n(repricing)" as Order
participant "resolveProductPricing\n(CPN-04)" as Resolve
participant "assignBucket\n(holdout pur)" as Bucket
participant "hash()\n(impl-définie)" as Hash

== Phase affichage (rendu du prix) ==
Display -> Resolve : resolveProductPricing(input, ctx{visitorKey, couponId, holdoutPct})
activate Resolve
Resolve -> Bucket : assignBucket(visitorKey, couponId, holdoutPct)
activate Bucket

alt visitorKey est null / undefined / ''
  Bucket --> Resolve : 'treatment'
  note right of Bucket
    INV-4 : jamais de holdout
    sans clé stable
  end note
else visitorKey présent
  Bucket -> Hash : hash(visitorKey + ':' + couponId)
  activate Hash
  Hash --> Bucket : entier H (déterministe)
  deactivate Hash
  Bucket -> Bucket : n = H % 100\nbucket = (n < clamp(holdoutPct,0,100)) ? 'holdout' : 'treatment'
  Bucket --> Resolve : bucket (treatment | holdout)
end
deactivate Bucket

Resolve --> Display : ResolvedPricing { effectivePriceCents, coupon{ id, bucket } }
deactivate Resolve
note over Display
  treatment -> prix remisé (ex. 19900)
  holdout   -> prix plein   (ex. 28900)
  => prix AFFICHÉ
end note

== Phase checkout (commande) ==
Order -> Resolve : resolveProductPricing(input, ctx{MÊME visitorKey, couponId, holdoutPct})
activate Resolve
Resolve -> Bucket : assignBucket(visitorKey, couponId, holdoutPct)
activate Bucket
Bucket -> Hash : hash(visitorKey + ':' + couponId)
activate Hash
Hash --> Bucket : MÊME entier H (fonction pure)
deactivate Hash
Bucket --> Resolve : MÊME bucket
deactivate Bucket
Resolve --> Order : ResolvedPricing { effectivePriceCents identique }
deactivate Resolve

== Vérification de l'invariant ==
Order -> Order : reprice : prix affiché == prix facturé ?
alt buckets/prix identiques (cas nominal garanti)
  note over Display, Order #DDEFD8
    GATE G-HOLDOUT-DETERMINISM ✔
    bucketDisplay == bucketOrderRepo
    => prix affiché == prix facturé
    => PAS de PriceMismatchError
  end note
else divergence (interdite)
  Order -> Order : throw PriceMismatchError 422
  note over Order #F6D9D4
    Ne doit JAMAIS arriver si assignBucket
    est pur et reçoit le MÊME visitorKey.
    Tout 422 ici = régression du gate.
  end note
end

@enduml
